  claim:    No candidate is scaled or subtracted; the residual does not move with the candidate list.
            residual with no candidates:    [0.19999999999999996, 0.19999999999999996, 0.20000000000000018, 0.19999999999999996, 0.19999999999999996]
            residual with three candidates: [0.19999999999999996, 0.19999999999999996, 0.20000000000000018, 0.19999999999999996, 0.19999999999999996]
            identical: True
            consistent candidates: ['a'] of three offered, ranked by nothing
